  "description": "Demolition of the existing houses and erection of a three storey flatted block consisting of 6 one bedroom flats and 3 two bedroom flats, parking and associated landscaping (outline application).",
  "site_name": "Street Record",
  "last_updated_by": "Northgate M3",
